msgid "Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Hm? You thinkin' about something, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "(Should I keep Rikiya with me?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Nah, it's nothing."
msgstr "Na, non è niente."

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Oh, all right. I was worried you were gonna split for a sec there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "I need to be alone for a bit if you don't mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "No problem, Aniki gets what Aniki wants! See ya 'round!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "How's it hangin', Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Uh, it's hanging... great?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Heh, glad to hear it! Now where we hittin' up next, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "I think that's enough sightseeing for one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Huh? Oh... if you say so. I guess just lemme know when you\r\n"
"got time to spare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "C'mon, Aniki..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"Let's get over to the <Color:7>intersection in Hatsumachi<Color:Default> where\r\n"
"that granny saw Saki-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"I'm comin' with you, Aniki! Let's get to <Color:7>Hatsumachi<Color:Default> and find\r\n"
"the little lady!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "We're gonna have to walk from here, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "(I don't remember agreeing to this...)"
msgstr "Non mi ricordo di aver accettato una cosa del genere..."

msgctxt "704"
msgid "(Well, I've come this far. Might as well see it through.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Let's get movin', Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "All right, all right."
msgstr "Va bene, va bene."

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Please, Aniki! You gotta talk the boss off the ledge!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Now c'mon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Nah, it's nothing."
msgstr "Na, non è niente."

msgctxt "800"
msgid "I need to be alone for a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "I think I've had enough sightseeing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Great."
msgstr "Ottimo."

